688
00:38:28,539 --> 00:38:33,610
10 prem.

689
00:38:33,610 --> 00:38:36,949
Tamam abi.

690
00:38:36,949 --> 00:38:38,949
Ya aslında hocam

691
00:38:38,949 --> 00:38:40,949
şey yazdı işte.

692
00:38:40,949 --> 00:38:42,949
Hasreti söyle falan yazdı

693
00:38:42,949 --> 00:38:45,179
Elif'e.

694
00:38:45,179 --> 00:38:47,179
Ben bir bilgi gelmedi bana.

695
00:38:47,179 --> 00:38:49,179
Okey.

696
00:38:49,179 --> 00:38:51,179
Yani

697
00:38:51,179 --> 00:38:54,010
